{"id":"steam-1353030","steam":1353030,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Eloquence","summary":"Collect phrases, decipher symbols, and speak a language you don't understand! Explore a vibrant and non-violent world inhabited by charming islanders in this award-winning Metroidbrainia.","about":"Learn to express yourself in a tailor-made, fully functional language! Understanding the symbols is only the beginning. Your goal is to use them in dialogs.  \n\nGATHER LANGUAGE\n\nCollect and store any phrase for later use. Discover what symbols mean by speaking them in conversations. These symbols are the only writing you'll find in the game!\n\nMASTER COMMUNICATION\n\nInitially, you can only repeat full sentences that you’ve collected. But the higher you climb, the more your language mastery grows. Develop the ability to split phrases into smaller chunks and craft your own sentences.\n\nDYNAMIC WORLD\n\nNavigate a volcanic island composed of colorful and lush sceneries, all beautifully and carefully painted by hand. Discover stunning landmarks and quaint structures that connect sites or that help you find your way forward. \r\n\nLOVABLE ISLANDERS\n\nThe islanders that settled on the volcano all have personal stories and relationships for you to discover and advance. They follow their own schedules and ambitions.\n\nTIME LOOPS\n\nThe eruption will destroy the island... unless you can reach the summit in time! Fail, and a mysterious power resets you to the start of your journey. Fortunately, every attempt increases your understanding of this world and grows your mastery over the language.\n\nSECRETS AND RIDDLES\n\nThe island is packed with secrets and mysteries. Study them closely to reveal the true nature of your arrival and purpose.\r\n  \n\n\r\n\nCan your eloquence save the island?\n\nNo AI was used in the development of this game.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/559e3d654e10a86d72dfdd25a0c9655bb4ce4322/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794092971","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/48add9611705ba0bf24c1b7bce27763a86789446/header.jpg?t=1794092971","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/19a0dfb0ad8dc4fec32559ab6e88e85133f26546/library_hero.jpg?t=1794092971","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/48add9611705ba0bf24c1b7bce27763a86789446/header.jpg?t=1794092971","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/b28d2681e17b90cf5baad1958c6e813540971600/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1794092971","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/214b73abf172d2075b0a4573fe3e71d7fccbddd8/ss_214b73abf172d2075b0a4573fe3e71d7fccbddd8.600x338.jpg?t=1794092971","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/214b73abf172d2075b0a4573fe3e71d7fccbddd8/ss_214b73abf172d2075b0a4573fe3e71d7fccbddd8.jpg?t=1794092971"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/905951543c3ccc553288d4bf1cd4f9c0aeb9db42/ss_905951543c3ccc553288d4bf1cd4f9c0aeb9db42.600x338.jpg?t=1794092971","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/905951543c3ccc553288d4bf1cd4f9c0aeb9db42/ss_905951543c3ccc553288d4bf1cd4f9c0aeb9db42.jpg?t=1794092971"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/6a345367e7be70d44d0edc8cc61e7c21090f92ca/ss_6a345367e7be70d44d0edc8cc61e7c21090f92ca.600x338.jpg?t=1794092971","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/6a345367e7be70d44d0edc8cc61e7c21090f92ca/ss_6a345367e7be70d44d0edc8cc61e7c21090f92ca.jpg?t=1794092971"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353030/a6fa6238dd47b3be7ab1117ab9ad37add21cc067/ss_a6fa6238dd47b3be7ab1117ab9ad37add21cc067.600x338.jpg?t=1794092971",